 with explicit lyrics. Pedestrians in towns can be knocked down by vehicles; they fall over and get back up, they cannot be killed or injured permanently."},"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"14","required_age":"14","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem imprópria\nViolência\nAtos criminosos"},"steam_germany":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"16","required_age":"16","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nDerbe Sprache"}}}}}